but I think I'll be okay.

00:16:47.589 --> 00:16:49.268 line:91%
<c.yellow>Okay.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>I just...</c>

00:16:49.268 --> 00:16:51.541 line:91%
I just wanna make sure
I get over this one a few times

00:16:51.541 --> 00:16:53.729 line:85%
before... getting up there.

00:16:53.920 --> 00:16:55.545 line:91%
First one of day two.
<c.yellow>Yeah.</c>

00:16:55.545 --> 00:16:58.544 position:59% line:91%
I woke up so confident.
<c.yellow>Let's see if you've forgotten it or...</c>

00:16:58.544 --> 00:17:01.123 line:91%
I woke up with completely
unjustified confidence.

00:17:01.123 --> 00:17:04.267 line:91%
I woke up going,
"I'm fine. This is gonna be great."

00:17:05.863 --> 00:17:07.964 position:61% line:91%
I don't know.
<c.yellow>I would say you earned your confidence.</c>

00:17:07.964 --> 00:17:10.101 line:91%
<c.yellow>I would say you worked
harder than I've seen</c>

00:17:10.101 --> 00:17:12.839 line:91%
<c.yellow>anyone who does
this work yesterday, so yeah.</c>

00:17:12.839 --> 00:17:15.204 line:85%
<c.yellow>Breathing, breathing, yeah.</c>

00:17:15.204 --> 00:17:16.454 line:85%
We're not there yet.

00:17:17.062 --> 00:17:19.099 line:85%
Come on, Tom. Come on.

00:17:19.099 --> 00:17:21.014 line:91%
Get your eye in.
You had this yesterday.

00:17:21.592 --> 00:17:23.405 line:85%
<c.yellow>Cool. Let it touch. It's great.</c>

00:17:23.405 --> 00:17:25.256 line:91%
<c.yellow>Keep the body straight
as you do so.</c>

00:17:25.256 --> 00:17:27.523 line:91%
<c.yellow>Let the arms bend down,
but keep the body straight.</c>

00:17:28.158 --> 00:17:29.953 line:85%
<c.yellow>Easy. Easy.</c>

00:17:30.319 --> 00:17:31.314 line:85%
<c.yellow>Great.</c>

00:17:31.314 --> 00:17:33.628 line:91%
<c.yellow>That was the best one
I've seen you do.</c>

00:17:33.628 --> 00:17:36.444 line:91%
I would normally be trying to
almost distract myself,

00:17:36.444 --> 00:17:41.484 position:64% line:91%
try and let my unconscious, subconscious,
whatever it is, do the balancing for me.

00:17:41.484 --> 00:17:44.816 position:61% line:91%
But I have to keep my head in the game,
focusing on what I'm doing.

00:17:44.816 --> 00:17:49.344 position:72% line:91%
As soon as I start talking, as soon as I start
focusing on what's going on outside...

00:17:50.235 --> 00:17:52.670 position:58% line:85%
Well, I won't use the word, but yeah.

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:55.950 line:85%
<c.yellow>I see it as enforced meditation.</c>

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:56.777 line:85%
Yeah.

00:17:56.777 --> 00:17:59.727 line:91%
How much of that foot pain
yesterday was me being scared?

00:17:59.727 --> 00:18:01.685 line:91%
I don't know.
<c.yellow>Oh, 100 percent.</c>

00:18:02.185 --> 00:18:05.314 position:61% line:91%
I'm not saying 100 percent. That was...
<c.yellow><i>(laughs)</i></c>

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:08.572 line:85%
<c.yellow>I think a better question is,</c>

00:18:08.572 --> 00:18:11.746 line:91%
<c.yellow>how much are we capable of,
if we let go of all the fear?</c>

00:18:13.675 --> 00:18:16.122 position:58% line:91%
Let's do it again. Let's do it again.
<c.yellow><i>(laughs)</i> Cool.</c>

00:18:23.254 --> 00:18:26.003 line:91%
Enforced meditation
is absolutely the right term.

00:18:26.003 --> 00:18:27.077 line:85%
<c.yellow><i>(snickers)</i></c>

00:18:27.077 --> 00:18:30.420 line:91%
Any time I feel my brain going,
"Nope, not thinking about that."

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:33.755 line:91%
Every time, my brain, I'll have to
bring it back, refocus on that.

00:18:33.755 --> 00:18:35.408 line:91%
<c.yellow>It's definitely true.
All you've got to do</c>

00:18:35.408 --> 00:18:37.708 line:85%
<c.yellow>is what you do here...</c>

00:18:37.708 --> 00:18:38.694 line:85%
...up there.

00:18:38.694 --> 00:18:40.190 line:91%
<c.yellow>Great. Well, have a rest.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Let's do it.</c>

00:18:40.190 --> 00:18:43.309 line:91%
<c.yellow>Give yourself a bit of a
sit-down, rest your feet.</c>

00:18:43.309 --> 00:18:47.091 position:63% line:91%
<c.yellow>We'll get the pole up,
and we'll get the harness ready for you.</c>

00:18:47.091 --> 00:18:48.940 line:91%
Alright.
<c.yellow>Amazing. Well done, Tom.</c>

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:51.005 line:91%
Let's do it.
Thank you, thank you.

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:57.000 align:start size:88% position:13% line:7%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (hollow tense music)</i></c>

00:18:56.801 --> 00:18:59.674 line:91%
<c.yellow>I can tell you that
that first step</c>

00:18:59.674 --> 00:19:03.595 position:58% line:91%
<c.yellow>is the most difficult one that you'll
ever make in your ropewalking career.</c>

00:19:03.595 --> 00:19:04.391 line:85%
Okay.

00:19:04.391 --> 00:19:07.287 line:91%
<c.yellow>And that's not saying to rush it
to quickly get to the second one.</c>

00:19:07.287 --> 00:19:08.891 line:91%
No, no.
<c.yellow>But to commit.</c>

00:19:08.891 --> 00:19:11.080 line:85%
<c.yellow>When you take up the pole...</c>

00:19:11.923 --> 00:19:15.008 line:91%
<c.yellow>...make a decision
that you want to go forward.</c>

00:19:15.008 --> 00:19:16.893 line:91%
Yeah.
<c.yellow>Take up the pole,</c>

00:19:16.893 --> 00:19:18.815 line:85%
<c.yellow>and then embark on a crossing.</c>

00:19:18.815 --> 00:19:22.841 line:91%
Yeah. All I need to do is
get that pole from there to there.

00:19:22.841 --> 00:19:23.861 line:85%
<c.yellow>Exactly.</c>

00:19:23.861 --> 00:19:25.315 line:85%
Alright, let's do it.

00:19:25.315 --> 00:19:26.134 line:85%
<c.yellow>Okay!</c>

00:19:38.013 --> 00:19:40.686 line:91%
There is a lot more wind
up here today!

00:19:40.686 --> 00:19:42.954 line:85%
<i>(slow breathing)</i>

00:19:58.106 --> 00:20:00.430 line:85%
It's exactly the same trick...

00:20:01.194 --> 00:20:03.003 line:85%
...whether the tightrope...

00:20:05.224 --> 00:20:07.601 position:56% line:85%
...is half a metre off the ground...

00:20:07.601 --> 00:20:09.590 line:85%
...or eight metres off the ground.

00:20:10.776 --> 00:20:12.461 line:85%
It's exactly the same thing.

00:20:20.436 --> 00:20:22.198 line:85%
It's exactly the same thing.

00:20:22.198 --> 00:20:23.196 line:85%
Pole up.

00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:28.150 align:start size:88% position:13% line:7%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (pulsing percussive music)</i></c>

00:20:45.283 --> 00:20:47.824 line:91%
<c.yellow>Keep breathing. Stay strong.
Lift the chest up.</c>

00:20:47.824 --> 00:20:49.298 line:85%
<c.yellow>Stay nice and tall.</c>

00:20:49.957 --> 00:20:51.926 line:91%
<c.yellow>Golden thread from the
centre of the head.</c>

00:20:51.926 --> 00:20:53.521 line:91%
No!
<c.yellow>Stay up.</c>

00:20:52.400 --> 00:20:54.400 align:start size:88% position:13% line:7%
<c.cyan><i>(music halts)</i></c>

00:20:54.106 --> 00:20:55.008 line:85%
<c.yellow>I got you.</c>

00:20:56.039 --> 00:20:57.600 line:85%
<c.yellow>I got you. Don't you worry.</c>

00:20:57.600 --> 00:20:59.827 line:91%
<c.yellow>Stay holding the pole.
Josh, can you grab the pole?</c>

00:21:04.046 --> 00:21:05.275 line:85%
<c.yellow>Nice one.</c>

00:21:08.666 --> 00:21:10.669 line:85%
<c.yellow>Okay, coming in the last bit.</c>

00:21:12.292 --> 00:21:13.268 line:85%
<c.yellow>Thanks, Josh.</c>

00:21:15.658 --> 00:21:17.097 line:85%
Let's do it again.

00:21:17.603 --> 00:21:18.732 line:85%
Let's do it again.

00:21:20.373 --> 00:21:21.246 line:85%
Let's do it again.

00:21:21.600 --> 00:21:26.600 align:start size:88% position:13% line:7%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (tense music resumes)</i></c>

00:21:23.346 --> 00:21:25.346 line:85%
<i>(deep breathing)</i>

00:21:33.150 --> 00:21:35.279 line:85%
