00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:41.500 align:start size:88% position:13% line:7%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (pulsing percussion)</i></c>

00:21:45.864 --> 00:21:48.976 line:91%
<c.yellow>Strong, stand up tall.
Stand up straight.</c>

00:21:49.285 --> 00:21:51.248 line:85%
<c.yellow>Strong and tall, Tom!</c>

00:21:51.473 --> 00:21:53.090 line:85%
<c.yellow>Keep breathing.</c>

00:21:53.090 --> 00:21:55.561 line:85%
<c.yellow>Slowly, walking forwards.</c>

00:21:55.561 --> 00:21:58.532 line:91%
<c.yellow>Keep with your balance.
Keep breathing.</c>

00:21:58.532 --> 00:22:01.605 line:91%
<c.yellow>Check those footsteps!
One by one.</c>

00:22:01.605 --> 00:22:03.627 line:85%
<c.yellow>Keep breathing with your breath.</c>

00:22:03.627 --> 00:22:05.570 line:85%
<c.yellow>I want to hear you breathe!</c>

00:22:05.570 --> 00:22:07.547 line:85%
<i>(strained breathing)</i>

00:22:05.570 --> 00:22:07.570 align:start size:88% position:13% line:7%
