00:22:07.547 --> 00:22:10.914 line:91%
<c.yellow>Keep going slowly.
Take your time.</c>

00:22:12.005 --> 00:22:13.677 line:85%
<c.yellow>Take it one step at a time.</c>

00:22:13.677 --> 00:22:15.486 line:91%
<c.yellow>You're all right.
Straighten up!</c>

00:22:18.587 --> 00:22:20.567 line:85%
<c.yellow>Okay, easy.</c>

00:22:20.567 --> 00:22:23.860 line:85%
<c.yellow>Step by step. Take your time.</c>

00:22:24.282 --> 00:22:26.469 line:85%
<c.yellow>Two feet on the wire, please.</c>

00:22:27.003 --> 00:22:29.472 line:85%
<c.yellow>Work it. Fight for it. Good.</c>

00:22:29.972 --> 00:22:32.710 line:91%
<c.yellow>Keep breathing.
Keep present.</c>

00:22:34.417 --> 00:22:37.199 line:85%
<i>(breathing accelerates)</i>

00:22:42.670 --> 00:22:45.284 line:85%
<c.yellow>Keep going, little by little.</c>

00:22:45.795 --> 00:22:49.394 line:85%
<c.yellow>Slow it down. Take your time.</c>

00:22:51.543 --> 00:22:55.226 line:91%
<c.yellow>You have all the time in the world,
