00:22:55.226 --> 00:22:57.401 line:85%
<c.yellow>This is your space.</c>

00:22:57.401 --> 00:22:59.757 line:85%
<c.yellow>Take control of the pole!</c>

00:22:59.757 --> 00:23:01.213 line:85%
<c.yellow>Fight for it, Tom!</c>

00:23:01.213 --> 00:23:03.345 line:85%
<c.yellow>Easy! Slow down.</c>

00:23:03.872 --> 00:23:05.451 line:85%
<c.yellow>Breathing.</c>

00:23:06.188 --> 00:23:07.908 line:85%
<c.yellow>Breathing all the way.</c>

00:23:07.908 --> 00:23:09.813 line:85%
<c.yellow>Five steps. Slow it down.</c>

00:23:11.471 --> 00:23:12.356 line:85%
<c.yellow>And...</c>

00:23:12.356 --> 00:23:13.734 line:85%
Yes!

00:23:13.734 --> 00:23:16.490 line:91%
<i>(grunts)</i>
<c.cyan><i>(applauds) </i>Woo!</c>

00:23:17.110 --> 00:23:18.040 line:85%
Yes!

00:23:22.620 --> 00:23:23.604 line:85%
Thank you, Chris!

00:23:23.604 --> 00:23:27.343 line:91%
<c.yellow>Alright, thank you Tom!
Well done, man!</c>

00:23:27.343 --> 00:23:29.974 line:85%
<c.yellow>Super cool. Super cool.</c>

00:23:29.974 --> 00:23:31.773 line:85%
It's the same trick!

00:23:34.743 --> 00:23:38.670 position:58% line:91%
I can happily just stand on this wire
with hands on here.

00:23:39.818 --> 00:23:41.027 line:85%
But you're right.

00:23:42.259 --> 00:23:46.335 position:56% line:91%
I would've touched the ground there.
I'd have considered that a failure.

00:23:46.335 --> 00:23:49.547 position:63% line:91%
There's one point, it felt like the pole
was way off down to the side.

00:23:49.547 --> 00:23:51.141 line:85%
I might throw up in a minute.

00:23:51.141 --> 00:23:54.236 line:91%
Have you ever seen anyone
vomit from eight metre high...?

00:23:54.236 --> 00:23:56.833 line:91%
<c.yellow>Take your time.
Take your time to breathe.</c>

00:23:56.833 --> 00:23:59.198 line:85%
<c.yellow>Take your time to feel grounded,</c>

00:23:59.198 --> 00:24:01.995 position:56% line:85%
<c.yellow>to arrive into that place of safety.</c>

00:24:06.069 --> 00:24:07.074 line:85%
<c.yellow>Great!</c>

00:24:09.160 --> 00:24:09.798 line:85%
<c.yellow>Yeah.</c>

00:24:10.708 --> 00:24:12.740 line:85%
<c.yellow>Amazing!</c>

00:24:12.740 --> 00:24:14.137 line:85%
<c.yellow>Alright!</c>

00:24:16.251 --> 00:24:18.832 line:91%
<c.yellow>Beautiful.
On your feet, ropewalker.</c>

00:24:18.832 --> 00:24:21.847 line:71%
<c.yellow>Hey! Welcome to my beautiful world.</c>

00:24:23.345 --> 00:24:24.623 line:71%
Thank you so much.

00:24:24.623 --> 00:24:25.908 line:71%
<c.yellow>Well done, man.</c>

00:24:26.718 --> 00:24:28.036 line:71%
<c.yellow>That was really beautiful.</c>

00:24:28.036 --> 00:24:29.631 line:71%
Oh, that was sketchy at the end.

00:24:29.631 --> 00:24:31.709 line:76%
It doesn't matter how much
you know that's there.

00:24:31.709 --> 00:24:33.296 position:59% line:71%
You still feel like you're gonna fall.

00:24:33.296 --> 00:24:34.606 line:71%
<c.yellow>It's incredible.</c>

00:24:34.606 --> 00:24:36.036 line:71%
<c.yellow>Don't use the F word.</c>

